
@Practical10_StudentAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7005

### Get All Students
GET {{Practical10_StudentAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Students
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Student By ID
GET {{Practical10_StudentAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Students/4
Accept: application/json

###

### Add New Student
POST {{Practical10_StudentAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Student",
  "email": "test@gmail.com",
  "course": "Computer Engineering",
  "semester": 5
}

###

### Update Student
PUT {{Practical10_StudentAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Students/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "Preet Vora Updated",
  "email": "preet@gmail.com",
  "course": "Computer Engineering",
  "semester": 6
}

###

### Delete Student
DELETE {{Practical10_StudentAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Students/5
